#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-dependencies/setuptools_scm.xml:93
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Setuptools_scm"
msgstr "Instalação do Setuptools_scm"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-dependencies/setuptools_scm.xml:95
#, xml-text
msgid "Build the module:"
msgstr "Construa o módulo:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-dependencies/setuptools_scm.xml:100
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-dependencies/setuptools_scm.xml:103
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>&install-wheel; setuptools_scm</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>&install-wheel; setuptools_scm</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-dependencies/setuptools_scm.xml:106
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the installation, make sure <xref linkend='pytest'/> and the other "
"optional dependencies are installed and run (<literal>HOME=</literal> "
"prevents the <filename>.gitconfig</filename> file in the home directory from"
" interfering the tests):"
msgstr ""
"Para testar a instalação, certifique-se de que <xref linkend='pytest'/> e as"
" outras dependências opcionais estejam instaladas e execute "
"(<literal>HOME=</literal> impede que o arquivo "
"<filename>.gitconfig</filename> no diretório inicial interfira nos testes):"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-dependencies/setuptools_scm.xml:113
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>python3 -m venv --system-site-packages testenv &amp;&amp;\n"
"testenv/bin/pip3 install --group test          &amp;&amp;\n"
"TZ=UTC HOME= testenv/bin/python3 -m pytest</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>python3 -m venv --system-site-packages testenv &amp;&amp;\n"
"testenv/bin/pip3 install --group test          &amp;&amp;\n"
"TZ=UTC HOME= testenv/bin/python3 -m pytest</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-dependencies/setuptools_scm.xml:118
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If <xref linkend='git'/> and/or <xref linkend='mercurial'/> are not "
"installed, the tests depending on the missing one(s) will be skipped.  Some "
"tests may invoke <xref linkend='sudo'/> and request a password."
msgstr ""
"Se <xref linkend='git'/> e (ou) <xref linkend='mercurial'/> não estiverem "
"instalados, os testes dependentes do(s) ausente(s) serão ignorados. Alguns "
"testes possivelmente invoquem <xref linkend='sudo'/> e solicitem uma senha."

